 * trigger's activation range.
 *
 * Initial: normal. Inherited: no.
 * Percentages: Relative to the specified named timeline range if specified, otherwise relative to
 * the entire timeline.
 *
 * Keyword effects:
 * - normal: A `<length>` or `<percentage>` value specifies an offset from the beginning of the
